{"id":"n3-028","title":"～そのために","romaji":"〜sono tame ni","jlptLevel":3,"shortExplanation":"For the purpose of; because of; in order to.","longExplanation":"The ～そのために grammar point is used to convey the purpose or reason behind an action or situation. It can be translated as 'for that reason', 'for the purpose of', or 'in order to' in English. It connects two sentences, where the first sentence gives a goal or reason, and the second sentence shows the resulting action.","formation":"Sentence/phrase 1 + そのために + Sentence/phrase 2","examples":[{"jp":"試験に合格するために、毎日勉強しています。そのために、早く寝て早く起きるようにしています。","romaji":"Shiken ni goukaku suru tame ni, mainichi benkyou shiteimasu. Sono tame ni, hayaku nete hayaku okiru you ni shiteimasu.","en":"I study every day to pass the exam. For that reason, I go to bed early and wake up early.","words":[{"surface":"試験","vocabId":"1312350","reading":"しけん"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"合格","vocabId":"1284600","reading":"ごうかく"},{"surface":"する","vocabId":"1595910","reading":"する"},{"surface":"ため","vocabId":"1157080","reading":"ため"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"毎日","vocabId":"1524720","reading":"まいにち"},{"surface":"勉強","vocabId":"1512670","reading":"べんきょう"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"い","vocabId":"1158500","reading":"い","baseForm":"いる"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null},{"surface":"その","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ため","vocabId":"1157080","reading":"ため"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"早く","vocabId":"1404975","reading":"はやく","baseForm":"早い"},{"surface":"寝て","vocabId":"1360010","reading":"ねて","baseForm":"寝る"},{"surface":"早く","vocabId":"1404975","reading":"はやく","baseForm":"早い"},{"surface":"起きる","vocabId":"1223640","reading":"おきる"},{"surface":"よう","vocabId":"1546200","reading":"よう"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"い","vocabId":"1158500","reading":"い","baseForm":"いる"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[14,15,16]},{"jp":"健康的な生活を送りたい。そのために、ジムに通って運動しています。","romaji":"Kenkouteki na seikatsu wo okuritai. Sono tame ni, jimu ni kayotte undou shiteimasu.","en":"I want to lead a healthy lifestyle. For that reason, I go to the gym and exercise.","words":[{"surface":"健康的","vocabId":"1256240","reading":"けんこうてき"},{"surface":"な","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"生活","vocabId":"1378860","reading":"せいかつ"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"送りたい","vocabId":"1402730","reading":"おくりたい","baseForm":"送る"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null},{"surface":"その","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ため","vocabId":"1157080","reading":"ため"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ジム","vocabId":"1314270","reading":"じむ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"通って","vocabId":"1432850","reading":"かよって","baseForm":"通う"},{"surface":"運動","vocabId":"1172910","reading":"うんどう"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"い","vocabId":"1158500","reading":"い","baseForm":"いる"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[6,7,8]},{"jp":"環境を守るために、リサイクルに取り組んでいます。そのために、ゴミを分別して捨てています。","romaji":"Kankyou wo mamoru tame ni, risaikuru ni torikundeimasu. Sono tame ni, gomi wo bunbetsu shite suteteimasu.","en":"I'm working on recycling to protect the environment. Therefore, I separate and dispose of trash properly.","words":[{"surface":"環境","vocabId":"1213280","reading":"かんきょう"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"守る","vocabId":"1327120","reading":"まもる"},{"surface":"ため","vocabId":"1157080","reading":"ため"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"リサイクル","vocabId":null},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"取り組んでいます","voc